      "en": "Then Isaiah the prophet came to King Hezekiah, and said to him, “What did these men say? From where did they come to you?” Hezekiah said, “They have come from a far country, even from Babylon.”",
      "ko": "선지자 이사야가 히스기야왕에게 나아와서 이르되 이 사람들이 무슨 말을 하였으며 어디서부터 왕에게 왔나이까 히스기야가 가로되 먼 지방 바벨론에서 왔나이다",
      "source_text_hash": "3c4347ba0b7d934675f5274532bedb068defd9a82dc6bea9e418f99f819ef058",
      "translation_text_hash": "497a51224099c1a3db9035f71cd206d17b8e8d8701f6ef0a09286513f08b98f5",
